  "newCodeRationale": "Donors lack the approved hostScopeHash/business-purpose and QueryGrant contract, tenant/KB/source epoch bindings, separate egress manifests and explicit remote freshness windows. New vendor-free PHP helpers compose existing Scope, validators, receipt hashing, AuthorizedSearchScope, PostgreSQL locks and baseline schema. No wire schema changed.",
